
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>AYT METAL</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:#111;color:#fff;font-family:Arial,sans-serif}
header{background:#080808;padding:35px 15px;text-align:center;border-bottom:4px solid #c28a32}
h1{font-size:45px;margin:0;color:#d69b40;letter-spacing:4px}
header p{color:#ddd}
.hero{padding:65px 20px;text-align:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#292929,#080808)}
h2{color:#d69b40;text-align:center}
.hero h2{font-size:30px}
.hero p{font-size:19px}
.services{padding:25px 15px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(200px,1fr));gap:15px;max-width:1000px;margin:auto}
.item{background:#222;border:1px solid #666;padding:28px 12px;text-align:center;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold;border-radius:8px}
.contact{text-align:center;background:#202020;padding:35px 15px}
.phone{display:inline-block;background:#c28a32;color:#111;padding:15px 25px;border-radius:7px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;font-size:22px}
footer{text-align:center;padding:20px;color:#aaa}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<h1>AYT METAL</h1>
<p>Metalin sanata dönüştüğü adres</p>
</header>
<section class="hero">
<h2>GÜÇLÜ METAL İŞÇİLİĞİ</h2>
<p>Kaliteli işçilik • Sağlam üretim • Güvenilir hizmet</p>
<p>SAKARYA • KOCAELİ VE ÇEVRE İLLER</p>
</section>
<h2>HİZMETLERİMİZ</h2>
<section class="services">
<div class="item">LAZER KAPI</div>
<div class="item">FERFORJE KAPI</div>
<div class="item">SUNDURMA</div>
<div class="item">BUNGALOV</div>
<div class="item">ÇİM ÇİT</div>
<div class="item">PANEL ÇİT</div>
<div class="item">PANJUR ÇİT</div>
<div class="item">DEMİR DOĞRAMA</div>
</section>
<section class="contact">
<h2>BİZE ULAŞIN</h2>
<p>Sipariş ve bilgi için hemen arayın.</p>
<a class="phone" href="tel:05529355541">0552 935 55 41</a>
</section>
<footer>© 2026 AYT METAL</footer>
</body>
</html>
